  "version": "0.5.5-beta.1",
  "notes": "## Changes since `v0.5.4`\n\n### Features\n\n- thank the open source projects tTerm is built on in a new About dialog, and list every third-party package that ships in the app with its license text under Open Source Licenses, collected at build time from cargo metadata for each release target and pnpm into public/licenses.json, since MIT, BSD, ISC and Apache ask that their notices travel with the binary ([29d8b79f](https://github.com/330079598/tTerm/commit/29d8b79fef1c3a65825252bcda3a21c03449238c))\n\n### Fixes\n\n- give the keyboard focus back to the terminal after renaming a tab, choosing from a context menu, closing a dialog, the tab search, broadcast or transfer panel, or the SFTP drawer, and keep clicks on tabs and toolbar buttons from taking it, since a dialog read where the focus came from only after its autoFocus input had taken it and so restored nothing, and a closing menu or panel dropped the focus on the page body, leaving typing to go nowhere until the terminal was clicked ([c4db70c1](https://github.com/330079598/tTerm/commit/c4db70c19b3d97a4a3e998523bf8c821e79d35e3))\n\n### Other changes\n\n- compile local_shell_integration_enabled only on unix like the local shell integration that calls it, since Windows builds warned it was never used ([a92a8842](https://github.com/330079598/tTerm/commit/a92a8842ebe71f4cae29013bd268e00e6cdc82c0))\n\n**Full comparison:** [v0.5.4...v0.5.5-beta.1](https://github.com/330079598/tTerm/compare/v0.5.4...v0.5.5-beta.1)",
